    "fullContentHtml":  "\n\u003ch1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\"\u003eSSC Delhi Police HC (Ministerial) Result 2026\u003c/h1\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\"\u003ePost Date: \u003ctime class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-06-05T13:37:30+05:30\"\u003eJune 5, 2026\u003c/time\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cspan class=\"custom-post-time\"\u003e1:37 pm\u003c/span\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://ssc.nic.in/\"\u003eStaff Selection Commission (SSC Delhi Police)\u003c/a\u003e,\u003c/strong\u003e has released the\u003cstrong\u003e Result \u003c/strong\u003eon its\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eofficial website\u003c/strong\u003e for the Recruitment of \u003cstrong\u003eDelhi Police HC (Ministerial) Examination 2026.\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;The\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eExam\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003cspan data-teams=\"true\"\u003ewas conducted on\u003cstrong\u003e 07 – 12 January 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e,\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;The\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eSSC\u003c/strong\u003e application process started on \u003cstrong data-start=\"319\" data-end=\"339\"\u003e29 September 2025\u003c/strong\u003e, and candidates were able to submit their applications until\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"424\"\u003e20 October 2025\u003c/strong\u003e. Candidates can check their \u003cstrong\u003eResult\u003c/strong\u003e using their \u003cstrong data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"362\"\u003eEnrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth\u003c/strong\u003e by logging into the portal. The direct link is provided below.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri\u0026amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    \u003c/a\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \n\u003cdiv class=\"social-buttons\"\u003e\u003c!-- WhatsApp Button --\u003e \u003ca class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e WhatsApp \u003c/a\u003e \u003c!-- Telegram Button --\u003e \u003ca class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e Telegram \u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\"\u003eSSC Delhi Police HC (Ministerial) Result 2026 – Out\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n\n\u003ch3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\"\u003eSSC Delhi Police Head Constable (Ministerial) Examination 2025 : Short Details\u003c/h3\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/ssc-delhi-police-hc-ministerial-2026/\"\u003eSarkariResult.com.cm\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImportant Dates\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eApply Online Start Date : \u003cstrong\u003e29 September 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eApply Online Last Date : \u003cstrong\u003e20 October 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eLast Date For Fee Payment : \u003cstrong\u003e21 October 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCorrection Date : \u003cstrong\u003e05-07 November 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eSlot Selection Starting Date\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e: 05 December 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eSlot Selection Last Date\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e: \u003cspan style=\"color: #000000;\"\u003e05 January 2026\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eExam Date :\u003cstrong\u003e 07 – 12 January 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eExam City Details :\u003cstrong\u003e 04 January 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eAnswer Key : \u003cb\u003e05 February 2026\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eResult Date : \u003cspan style=\"color: #ff0000;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e05 June 2026 Available Now\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCandidates are advised to confirm from the \u003cstrong\u003eSSC Delhi Police \u003c/strong\u003eofficial website.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eApplication Fee\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eFor \u003cstrong\u003eGeneral, OBC, EWS \u003c/strong\u003e:\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e₹ 100/-\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eFor \u003cstrong\u003eSC, ST, PWD Candidates\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;:\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e₹\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"blue bold\"\u003e00/-\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePayment Mode (Online):\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;You can make the payment using the following methods:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eDebit Card\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCredit Card\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eInternet Banking\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eIMPS\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCash Card / Mobile Wallet\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\"\u003e\n\u003ch5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\"\u003eSSC Delhi Police Head Constable (Ministerial) Notification 2025 : Age Limit As On 01 July 2025\u003c/h5\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eMinimum Age :\u003cstrong\u003e 18 Years\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eMaximum Age :\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e25 Years\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSSC\u003c/strong\u003e provides age relaxation for the \u003cstrong\u003eDelhi\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003ePolice Head Constable (Ministerial) \u003c/strong\u003eposition as per their regulations.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTotal Post\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\"\u003e456 Posts\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c!-- SarkariResult --\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri\u0026amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    \u003c/a\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c!-- SarkariResult --\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\"\u003e\n\u003ch6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\"\u003eSSC Delhi Police Head Constable (Ministerial) Recruitment 2025 : Vacancy Details \u003c/h6\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 125px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 25px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 34.9487%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePost Name\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 65.0513%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNo. Of Post\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 25px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 34.9487%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eDelhi Police Head Constable (Ministerial)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 65.0513%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e456\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 25px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 34.9487%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePost Name\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 65.0513%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEligibility Criteria\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 34.9487%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eDelhi Police Head Constable (Ministerial)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 65.0513%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"86\" data-end=\"196\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"88\" data-end=\"196\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCandidates must have passed \u003cstrong data-start=\"116\" data-end=\"193\"\u003e10+2 (Senior Secondary) or equivalent examination from a recognized board\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"197\" data-end=\"311\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"199\" data-end=\"311\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eMust possess a \u003cstrong data-start=\"214\" data-end=\"308\"\u003etyping speed of 30 words per minute in English OR 25 words per minute in Hindi on computer\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;How To Check \u0026amp; Download SSC Delhi Police HC (Ministerial) Result 2026\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"120\" data-end=\"174\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eOpen your internet browser on your phone or computer\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"177\" data-end=\"249\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eVisit the \u003cstrong data-start=\"187\" data-end=\"247\"\u003eofficial website of the Staff Selection Commission (SSC)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"252\" data-end=\"352\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eOn the homepage, go to the \u003cstrong data-start=\"279\" data-end=\"342\"\u003eLatest Notifications / Candidate Information / Exam Details\u003c/strong\u003e section\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"355\" data-end=\"445\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eLook for the link that says \u003cstrong data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"443\"\u003eSSC Delhi Police HC (Ministerial) Result 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"448\" data-end=\"497\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eClick on the \u003cb\u003eResult \u003c/b\u003enotification\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"584\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eYou may need to enter your \u003cstrong data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"582\"\u003eRegistration Number / Roll Number and Date of Birth\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"669\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eAfter entering details, your \u003cstrong data-start=\"616\" data-end=\"641\"\u003eresult\u003c/strong\u003e will appear on the screen\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"764\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eIf the information opens as a \u003cstrong data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"709\"\u003ePDF\u003c/strong\u003e, use the search feature to find your \u003cstrong data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"762\"\u003eroll number\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"830\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eDownload or save the \u003cstrong data-start=\"788\" data-end=\"813\"\u003eresult PDF\u003c/strong\u003e to your device\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"875\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eTake a \u003cstrong data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"852\"\u003eprintout\u003c/strong\u003e for future reference\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;SSC Delhi Police Head Constable (Ministerial) Recruitment 2025 : Mode Of Selection\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"wp-block-list\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCBT\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePE \u0026amp; MT\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTrade Test\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDocument Verification\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMedical Examination\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #cc0052; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eJoin Our WhatsApp Channel\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\